WEBVTT

00:01:58.656 --> 00:02:01.450
We won't be able
to electrify all of our sectors.

00:02:01.492 --> 00:02:02.660
And here's why.

00:02:03.411 --> 00:02:06.873
Let's start with an example
from the industrial sector.

00:02:07.874 --> 00:02:10.751
Molecules create the reaction,

00:02:10.793 --> 00:02:12.003
not electrons.

00:02:12.044 --> 00:02:16.549
To make steel the old way
we first mine iron ore,

00:02:16.591 --> 00:02:20.845
then burn coal to remove
the oxygen from the iron mix.

00:02:21.304 --> 00:02:24.265
Seven to nine percent
of our world's CO2 emissions

00:02:24.265 --> 00:02:25.975
come from this process.

00:02:26.976 --> 00:02:29.645
It's the coal that provides the molecule,

00:02:29.645 --> 00:02:32.273
creating the reaction
to get rid of the oxygen.